35,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The budget is down a quarter, and home visits earn nothing.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The call-back trial worked, but home visits often fail to happen.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
