39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,Joint clinics fail when no one owns the rota.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, if home visits aren't billed, how do we fund them?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
