42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, if we can't book it, does it exist?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, exactly. And the car park is already full.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, the joint clinic closed because neither side signed up.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,So home follow-up is financially unviable without on-site billing.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,But the readmission drop is real. We need a hybrid model.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,Midwifery has capacity. Perinatal support could work on-site.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,On-site fits the booking system and the room constraints.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,We must ensure clear ownership to avoid another joint failure.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. On-site programs are more sustainable given the tariffs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,"I support on-site, but we need clear metrics to prove impact.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,I vote for the Perinatal Support Service. It uses existing slack.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
